  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="25">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 25</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="25" corresp="#wit-h">Gif ceapmon uppe on folce ceapige, dó þæt beforan gewitnesse.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="25" corresp="#wit-e">LXVIIII. Gif ciepemon uppe on folce ceapie, do þæt beforan gewitnessum.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="25" corresp="#wit-q">Si mercator in populo emat aliquid, faciat hoc coram testibus.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#jurasinski-and-oliver" n="25" corresp="#wit-e">{LXVIIII} Gif ciepemon uppe on folce ceapie, do þæt beforan gewitnessum.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#jurasinski-and-oliver" corresp="#wit-e">If a merchant does trade out in the countryside, let him do it in the presence of witnesses.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-e">If a trader [makes his way into] the interior of the country and [proceeds to] traffic, he shall do so before witnesses.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Wenn ein Kaufmann landeinwärts im Volke handelt, thue er das vor Zeugen.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">If a merchant trades up-country among the people, let him do so before witnesses.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
